# Paths that exist only in the fork (scripts/fork/verify-sync.sh leaves them out of the comparison with upstream).
# Only paths upstream does not have: if upstream adds one, the replay stops on a conflict.
# Never list a file upstream owns (README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, LICENSE, ci.yml, Cargo.toml, ...), except the test
# files the fork edits on purpose (below): the fork is the product and upstream is an input, so it may change
